Data note
---------

The real MER/LMP energy-cost workbook used in earlier work by this group is
proprietary and is deliberately excluded from this repository (see .gitignore).
Nothing in this repository depends on it.

A synthetic replacement, `instances/MER_LMP_Information_synthetic.xlsx`, is
included and may be redistributed freely. It was produced by sampling from a
multivariate normal fitted to the real data's per-time-slot means and
inter-vertiport covariance; it preserves those aggregate statistics only, and
no individual real reading appears in it. See `instances/README.md` for the
cell-by-cell verification and for its coverage limitation.
